/t_thumb/sc13k00.jpg"}], "slug": "magical-girl-taboo-village--1", "storyline": "\"The day I received magic was also the day of my death.\"\n\nWatanuki Sakuya wakes up in an old shrine, only to find the corpse of a girl hanging before her, flowers blooming out of every part of her corpse. She was meant to have visited the village with her best friend, and yet, what could've occured to lead to such a thing...?\n\nNine other girls are at the shrine. All of the surviving girls also have flowers blooming from one eye. A girl called Yumemi appears, claiming to the one in-charge, and explains the situation;\n\n\"\u2014You are all magical girls, chosen for the sake of the Kamibana.\"\n\nEvery evening, at 8 p.m., during the Hanamukenogi ceremony; a girl is chosen to be offered to the sacred flower and hanged.", "summary": "The girls awaken in a mysterious village cursed by flowers. Every night at 8 PM, one girl is chosen as a sacrifice to the Kamibana\u2014and hanged. Unravel the village\u2019s tangled mysteries and sever the ritual\u2019s endless cycle. A magical girl \u00d7 folk-horror suspense visual novel from Acacia.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/magical-girl-taboo-village--1", "videos": [{"id": 159866, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "MYVxJm1x1_Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MYVxJm1x1_Y", "title": "\u521d\u5831PV\u300e\u9b54\u6cd5\u5c11\u5973\u30ce\u56e0\u7fd2\u6751\u300f", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MYVxJm1x1_Y/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 179882, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "UULC_Wo-xLI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UULC_Wo-xLI", "title": "\u300e\u9b54\u6cd5\u5c11\u5973\u30ce\u56e0\u7fd2\u6751\u300f AnimeJapan2026\u51fa\u5c55 \u30c6\u30a3\u30b6\u30fcPV", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UULC_Wo-xLI/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 189499, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "jlzG8ik0WtE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jlzG8ik0WtE", "title": "\u3010\u9b54\u6cd5\u5c11\u5973\u30ce\u56e0\u7fd2\u6751\